      "content": "i hear you, but i really hate the idea of going back to the clinic just for a supplement. can you just tell me if it's actually dangerous? i mean, if i take it eventually and then just skip a day if i feel weird, would that be okay? i just want a definitive answer so i can feel better without all the hassle of an appointment.",
